@startuml Android Activity Launch Sequence
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 150

title Android Activity Launch Process Sequence Diagram

participant "App/Launcher" as App
participant "ActivityThread" as AT
participant "Instrumentation" as Instr
participant "ActivityManagerService" as AMS
participant "PackageManagerService" as PMS
participant "WindowManagerService" as WMS
participant "Zygote" as Zygote
participant "New App Process" as NewApp
participant "Activity" as Activity
participant "SurfaceFlinger" as SF

== Launch Request ==
App -> AT: startActivity(Intent)
AT -> Instr: execStartActivity(Intent)
Instr -> AMS: startActivity(Intent)

== Intent Resolution & Validation ==
AMS -> PMS: resolveActivity(Intent)
PMS --> AMS: ActivityInfo
AMS -> AMS: checkPermissions()
AMS -> AMS: findOrCreateTaskRecord()

== Process Management ==
alt Process doesn't exist (Cold Start)
    AMS -> Zygote: fork new process
    Zygote -> NewApp: create process
    NewApp -> AT: main()
    AT -> AMS: attachApplication()
    AMS -> AT: bindApplication()
    AT -> AT: handleBindApplication()
    AT -> Activity: Application.onCreate()
else Process exists (Warm/Hot Start)
    note over AMS: Use existing process
end

== Activity Creation ==
AMS -> AT: scheduleLaunchActivity()
AT -> AT: handleLaunchActivity()
AT -> Instr: newActivity()
Instr -> Activity: new Activity()
AT -> Activity: attach()

== Activity Lifecycle - onCreate ==
AT -> Instr: callActivityOnCreate()
Instr -> Activity: onCreate(Bundle)
Activity -> Activity: setContentView()
Activity -> Activity: inflate layouts
Activity --> Instr: return
Instr --> AT: return

== Window Creation & Setup ==
Activity -> WMS: addWindow()
WMS -> WMS: createWindowState()
WMS -> SF: createSurface()
SF --> WMS: Surface
WMS --> Activity: return

== Activity Lifecycle - onStart ==
AT -> Instr: callActivityOnStart()
Instr -> Activity: onStart()
Activity --> Instr: return
Instr --> AT: return

== Activity Lifecycle - onResume ==
AT -> Instr: callActivityOnResume()
Instr -> Activity: onResume()
Activity -> WMS: setWindowVisible(true)
WMS -> WMS: updateWindowVisibility()
Activity --> Instr: return
Instr --> AT: return

== Window Display & Focus ==
WMS -> SF: show surface
SF -> SF: composite layers
WMS -> WMS: setFocusedWindow()
WMS -> Activity: onWindowFocusChanged(true)

== Input Setup ==
WMS -> WMS: registerInputChannel()
WMS -> Activity: setup input events

== Launch Complete ==
AT -> AMS: activityResumed()
AMS -> App: onActivityResult() [if needed]

note over App, SF
    Activity is now visible and interactive
    User can interact with the UI
end note

@enduml